@startuml
|Production Manager|
start
:Start shooting;
fork
  |Location Team|
  :Create all-elements iterator;
  :Mark each cleared Location filmed;
fork again
  |Crew Coordinator|
  :Create CrewIterator;
  :Check VIP and other crew presence;
end fork
if (Any crew missing?) then (yes)
  :Transition to VIPMissing or OtherMissing;
else (no)
  :Request finishShooting;
endif
stop
@enduml